<section id="colocation">
  <h2>Neocloud vs colocation</h2>
  <p>A colocation landlord rents space and power. The tenant brings the machines. A neocloud
  rents compute and runs the machines. Many neoclouds are tenants of a colocation landlord, so
  one provider can sit on both sides of this line. See the <a href="/leasing/">leasing</a> page
  for what landlords ask of tenants.</p>
