<section id="sovereign">
  <h2>Neocloud vs sovereign cloud</h2>
  <p>A sovereign cloud is sold on where the capacity sits and who controls it, not on price or
  speed. This site files state-backed and national-champion compute under
  <a href="/providers/category/cat-sovereign/">sovereign or national</a>. Some of those
  providers are neocloud-like (GPU cloud), some are landlords and some are public supercomputing
  centres. Example rows, as each company describes itself:</p>
  <ul>
  {% for r in site.providers %}{% if r.id == "evroc" or r.id == "polarise" or r.id == "mistral-compute" or r.id == "bsc" %}
